#, boost-format
msgid "Reopened · generated %1%"
msgstr "Открыт повторно · создан %1%"

# AI Translated
#. TRN A reopened calibration test's line. %1%: the day it was made, as "21 Oct 2026".
#, boost-format
msgid "Opened from Home · generated %1%"
msgstr "Открыто с главной · создано %1%"

# AI Translated
#. TRN %1%: the project the test was opened from, %2%: the day it was made, as "21 Oct 2026".
#, boost-format
